# Short plain-text descriptions of packers and protectors that DIE shows in its UI; some have
# long lines that lintian mistakes for minified code. They are the preferred form for editing.
detectiteasy source: source-is-missing [XInfoDB/info/html/*]
# Upstream's prebuilt OpenSSL DLLs for its Windows builds. The Linux build never uses them.
detectiteasy source: source-contains-prebuilt-windows-binary [build_tools/openssl/*]
